    p
      | &#x1FA91; Our Furniture Services
      | At Mayondo Wood &amp; Furniture Ltd, we take pride in offering a comprehensive range of furniture solutions tailored to meet the needs of both residential and commercial clients. Our services combine craftsmanship, creativity, and quality materials to deliver furniture that is both functional and elegant.
      | 1. Custom Furniture Design
      | We design and craft furniture pieces that reflect your personal taste, space requirements, and functionality needs. Whether you need a modern office desk, a classic dining set, or luxury lounge furniture, our skilled artisans bring your ideas to life with precision and style.
      | 2. Home &amp; Office Furnishing
      | We supply and install a wide selection of furniture for homes, offices, schools, hotels, and other institutions. From living room sets to ergonomic office chairs and executive tables, we ensure comfort, durability, and a beautiful finish in every piece.
      | 3. Furniture Repair &amp; Restoration
      | Our team restores worn-out or damaged furniture to its original beauty. We refinish, re-upholster, polish, and replace parts where necessary&mdash;extending the lifespan of your furniture and saving you replacement costs.
      | 4. Interior Woodwork &amp; Joinery
      | We offer expert carpentry and joinery services, including cabinetry, wardrobes, wooden ceilings, doors, and partitions. Our craftsmen use locally sourced and imported wood species to match your design and durability preferences.
      | 5. Bulk &amp; Contract Supply
      | We handle bulk furniture orders for institutions, construction projects, and real estate developments. Our production capacity and reliable delivery systems make us the preferred partner for large-scale furniture supply and installation.
      | 6. Furniture Maintenance
      | We provide regular maintenance services to keep your furniture looking new and performing well. This includes re-polishing, tightening joints, and preventive treatments against termites and moisture.
      | 7. Delivery &amp; Installation
      | We ensure safe delivery and professional installation of all our furniture products. Our team handles every item with care &mdash; from factory to your premises &mdash; guaranteeing that each piece is properly assembled and ready for use.
